																"fragmentLink": {
																},
																"text": {
																	"value_i18n": {
																		"en_US": "<h2>Feature List</h2>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Full-stack integrated development (frontend + backend + database)</li>\n\t<li>Centralized directory of reusable business objects</li>\n\t<li>Fully QA/QC passed</li>\n\t<li>Compatible with CI/CD</li>\n\t<li>Build &amp; deploy microservices on the browser</li>\n\t<li>Liferay Developer Studio compatible</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Easier &amp; Faster to Market</h2>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Extension of Liferay Developer Studio (pre-implemented services and integrated portlets)</li>\n\t<li>DXP Developer Tool (Productivity, Plugin 2)</li>\n\t<li>Easiest way to manage custom objects and generating code for business objects and features for DXP</li>\n\t<li>Build more and faster on Liferay</li>\n\t<li>Engage more users/reduce user turnover</li>\n\t<li>Validate your hypothesis on Liferay (+ ARAD Studio)</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h4>Company Profile</h4>\nArmantec Systems is a Liferay boutique firm building enterprise grade portals and other line of business applications using our ARAD Studio. We help customers reduce Liferay DXP TCO by increasing development efficiency up to 1000%.<br>\n<br>\nWe are a group of engineers with a combined experience of over 100 man years in Liferay. We have experience working with tech/non-tech start-ups and industries such as aviation, physical/social/cyber security, healthcare, government, education, and e-Commerce.<br>\n<br>\nWebsite<br>\n<a href=\"https://arad-studio.com/\">https://arad-studio.com</a><br>\n<br>\nEmail<br>\n<a href=\"mailto:connect@armantecsystems.com\" target=\"_blank\">connect@armantecsystems.com</a>"
																	}
																}
